    def test_the_owner_replies_to_his_own_words_and_to_his_answer_on_a_card(self):
        """The owner's own bubble and the "Answer: …" row of a card carry "Reply": the quote is his text (for a card — what he
        chose), the reply goes to this feed's session; a quote jump lands on the owner's row, not on a session's later line."""
